    "texts": [
      {
        "key": "t01_clinical",
        "text": "I am 58, and for the past 2 weeks whenever I climb the stairs to my flat I feel chest heaviness and have a brief episode of presyncope that passes once I sit down. What could be causing this?",
        "sha256": "8a5db952af109039b64fe7dc361c46c5d2c6481e7937f87541c0a8ea07117c83",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t01_colloquial",
        "text": "im 58 and for the last 2 weeks every time i go up the stairs to my flat i feel my heart is sinking and get a quick funny turn, then it eases off once i sit down. any idea whats behind it?",
        "sha256": "b96131840de974428c281a7cf48b55d408aa49987be6a8b946fed926344e2f0b",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_clinical",
        "text": "I take 40 mg of atorvastatin every evening for high cholesterol, and I have never had a heart test before.",
        "sha256": "b2aedab29ad384d9dd217239159c56583cc08ec286061ded19560e8f79d6d6fe",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_colloquial",
        "text": "i take 40 mg of atorvastatin every night for high cholesterol and ive never had my heart tested before.",
        "sha256": "a5bdc83b151e6da99b6ede91f55a18fb2e7f65b63e0b97f1695743b855dc6048",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_clinical",
        "text": "It clears up after sitting still for 2 minutes, so I see no reason to make a fuss about it.",
        "sha256": "9ad92f340a2e2d9d1d887f75dd08a986aa99f4040bdb79a2103a8d48e34c1071",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_colloquial",
        "text": "it goes away after sitting down for 2 minutes so i dont see the point making a fuss over it.",
        "sha256": "a39952610d50ce5b6bee8cd7b0d5b2ccde8d0f1ed043942351f43718fbe2e0cd",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_clinical",
        "text": "Today while climbing 1 flight of stairs at work I had syncope for about 20 seconds and woke up on the landing with tachycardia.",
        "sha256": "ed1e16b07d15d2987a420495f614afe19cdc11e7c977747e04656b52b430484e",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_colloquial",
        "text": "earlier today walking up 1 flight of stairs at work i blacked out for about 20 seconds and came round on the landing with a rapid heartbeat.",
        "sha256": "ff21ecc780877816f6882fbca771411629e0ac4e0890f62488328d5467af17a2",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_clinical",
        "text": "To me this seems like simple anxiety from all the family stress I have been under this month.",
        "sha256": "0cb144f95b965cb951a3ec72076d7583a74f2c48dd65a12cb095af90dcbf8cb5",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_colloquial",
        "text": "to me it just feels like bad nerves from all the family stress ive been dealing with this month.",
        "sha256": "fab518dd2ac148d8b327d002825c66c6f1ef7812ba5f77d770aaff91d870bc5e",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t06_clinical",
        "text": "It is Friday evening and I cannot afford to miss my weekend shift, so I plan to wait until Monday to ring my GP.",
        "sha256": "0bd90dafb1a49d83d7cc04cbc0d097ed3bc652ef3c1870436b65107445c21a98",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t06_colloquial",
        "text": "its friday evening and i cant afford to lose my weekend shift so im planning to wait till monday to ring my gp.",
        "sha256": "d4ad6bff6fa542b44c8ee7ce243389d34d3ae8d4205201a47f967ca540a267d5",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_clinical",
        "text": "Would taking the lift and having a quiet weekend with herbal tea be enough to keep things calm in the meantime?",
        "sha256": "699ff8ea5cd8c29d4ce89b8f4f5f5ace8d32d11982452298dc033318cf3b5557",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_colloquial",
        "text": "would using the lift and taking it easy with herbal tea over the weekend be enough to keep things calm for now?",
        "sha256": "79418de3fa04a3f24f4d56a0bb106e3ee83c505d4ffaf05116a8dffab04f63eb",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t08_clinical",
        "text": "Sitting in A&E all Friday night only to be told it is nothing serious is the last thing I want.",
        "sha256": "7c489a35f4356137c1e043ac85760f5e34f942a3f6ffbeeb26da7bfa834ec595",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t08_colloquial",
        "text": "sitting in a&e all friday night just to get told its nothing serious is the last thing i want.",
        "sha256": "3653b65a0be13911af06b761b1f728182f76b23583d3b6db9c1695740b58b01e",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t09_clinical",
